 null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-18T15:03:06Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Because it’s the weekend, I thought I will do a longish set. Total of 18 questions for the 18th day of the month, between 10 and 20 points each. Total of 240 points to win.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-18T15:03:29Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "While revising was wondering which ones will you pick up 😂", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-18T15:03:42Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Quite a variety to pick from 😂", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-18T15:04:01Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "yes one reason i did so many was that richness of choices", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-18T15:04:09Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "first question", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-18T15:04:16Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "1.\tOn April 18, 1938, a book went on sale for $0.10 a copy with the cover date of June 1938. Inside was the debut of X. Two young men from Cleveland, Ohio — Jerry Siegel, a writer, and Joe Shuster, an artist — had been shopping their creation around to publishers for years, collecting rejection after rejection. When they finally sold the rights, they received a total of $130 (about $2,800 in today's money). Their character X went on to become the most recognizable fictional figure in the world, spawning an entire genre of storytelling. In 2014, a near-perfect original copy of this comic book was sold on eBay for $3.2 million. ID X (10 points).", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-1